    },
    {
      "s": 851.97,
      "e": 855.59,
      "text": "so we started off block one with just one flight in the first week,"
    },
    {
      "s": 855.92,
      "e": 859.23,
      "text": "and then we worked up to two flights in the same week."
    },
    {
      "s": 859.64,
      "e": 862.91,
      "text": "We've now worked up to doing two flights in one day"
    },
    {
      "s": 863.06,
      "e": 866.07,
      "text": "and up to four flights in a week."
    },
    {
      "s": 868.97,
      "e": 871.54,
      "text": "flight test is all about a build up approach."
    },
    {
      "s": 871.54,
      "e": 874.51,
      "text": "We don't want to just go out as fast as we can on the first try."
    },
    {
      "s": 874.51,
      "e": 876.41,
      "text": "So we step carefully."
    },
    {
      "s": 876.41,
      "e": 878.68,
      "text": "We go a little bit higher. We go a little bit faster."
    },
    {
      "s": 878.68,
      "e": 882.21,
      "text": "Each one of those test points expands the envelope."
    },
    {
      "s": 886.17,
      "e": 887.89,
      "text": "We also go"
    },
    {
      "s": 887.89,
      "e": 891.81,
      "text": "slower and lower, because sometimes that's a little more hazardous."
    },
    {
      "s": 891.81,
      "e": 895.06,
      "text": "So we get the airplane to its minimum speed and we've achieved"
    },
    {
      "s": 895.06,
      "e": 898.05,
      "text": "that as well on block one."
    },
    {
      "s": 899.37,
      "e": 902.38,
      "text": "For higher and faster in block one, we got again"
    },
    {
      "s": 902.38,
      "e": 905.96,
      "text": "got up to 43,000ft and about 2.96 mark."
    },
    {
      "s": 906.44,
      "e": 910.09,
      "text": "The next step in the next phase, of course, will be taking in supersonic."
    },
    {
      "s": 913.71,
      "e": 915.33,
      "text": "So the flight test"
    },
    {
      "s": 915.33,
      "e": 920.32,
      "text": "maneuvers we do, such as bank to bank rolls or side slips, are all designed"
    },
    {
      "s": 920.32,
      "e": 923.81,
      "text": "to prove that the airplane is safe to fly in a normal envelope"
    },
    {
      "s": 926.58,
      "e": 927.76,
      "text": "down the road, when we're"
    },
    {
      "s": 927.76,
      "e": 931.23,
      "text": "flying it around the country, we don't have to worry about"
    },
    {
      "s": 931.6,
      "e": 934.8,
      "text": "whether I can roll to the left and pull hard on the stick."
    },
    {
      "s": 935.02,
      "e": 938.97,
      "text": "All these things have been proven in flight test with the control room"
    },
    {
      "s": 938.97,
      "e": 940.36,
      "text": "backing us up the whole way."
    },
    {
      "s": 943.42,
      "e": 946.39,
      "text": "So we've spent years flying our simulator."
    },
    {
      "s": 946.39,
      "e": 950.08,
      "text": "So we have an idea how we think the airplane is going to fly,"
    },
    {
      "s": 950.45,
      "e": 955.04,
      "text": "from a handling quality standpoint, it feels a lot like the simulator."
    },
    {
      "s": 955.4,
      "e": 957.71,
      "text": "Big differences. The simulator doesn't have motion."
    },
    {
      "s": 957.71,
      "e": 961.28,
      "text": "So now we get to feel all the the motions of the aircraft,"
    },
    {
      "s": 961.28,
      "e": 965.9,
      "text": "the oscillations, vibrations,  things that you get in in a real airplane."
    },
    {
      "s": 966.58,
      "e": 969.47,
      "text": "Performance wise, our airplane actually seems to be going"
    },
    {
      "s": 969.47,
      "e": 972.8,
      "text": "faster and climbing better than the simulator even predicted."
    },
    {
      "s": 972.8,
      "e": 975.79,
      "text": "So that's exciting news."
    },
    {
      "s": 977.94,
      "e": 980.83,
      "text": "Every time we go fly this airplane, we learn more about it."
    },
    {
      "s": 980.83,
      "e": 981.91,
      "text": "We learn something new."
    },
    {
      "s": 981.91,
      "e": 984.67,
      "text": "We also just learn how to be more efficient."
    },
    {
      "s": 984.67,
      "e": 987.94,
      "text": "So our maintenance crew is getting very familiar with the airplane."
    },
    {
      "s": 987.94,
      "e": 991.19,
      "text": "They're able to process the airplane after landing"
    },
    {
      "s": 991.19,
      "e": 995.33,
      "text": "and turn it around for the next flight in shorter and shorter time spans."
    },
    {
      "s": 999.0,
      "e": 1001.9,
      "text": "So during envelope expansion, every flight"
    },
    {
      "s": 1001.9,
      "e": 1005.32,
      "text": "we go out and we do something that hasn't been done yet with the airplane."
    },
    {
      "s": 1005.32,
      "e": 1008.47,
      "text": "And those are the test cards or test points that we're trying to reach."
    },
    {
      "s": 1008.47,
      "e": 1010.88,
      "text": "So every day we prove something new."
    },
    {
      "s": 1010.88,
      "e": 1014.86,
      "text": "The airplane can can go higher, it can go faster, or it can go slower."
    },
    {
      "s": 1015.28,
      "e": 1018.05,
      "text": "But every everything we're doing is new."
    },
    {
      "s": 1018.05,
      "e": 1019.88,
      "text": "And that's the point of envelope expansion."
    },
    {
      "s": 1019.88,
      "e": 1023.99,
      "text": "And once we've expanded the envelope and there's nothing new left to do, then"
    },
    {
      "s": 1024.14,
      "e": 1027.14,
      "text": "we're done and the airplane is ready to go."
    },
    {
      "s": 1030.19,
      "e": 1032.83,
      "text": "The success of block one"
    },
    {
      "s": 1032.83,
      "e": 1036.5,
      "text": "was expanding both in altitude and airspeed"
    },
    {
      "s": 1037.19,
      "e": 1041.96,
      "text": "to prove out the system performance, as well as the vehicle handling qualities."
    },
    {
      "s": 1042.54,
      "e": 1046.61,
      "text": "And validate that it's matching predictions to give us confidence"
    },
    {
      "s": 1046.61,
      "e": 1048.46,
      "text": "to proceed even further."
    },
    {
      "s": 1048.46,
      "e": 1053.2,
      "text": "And speed and altitude as we proceeded to supersonic test flights."
    },
    {
      "s": 1056.92,
      "e": 1059.96,
      "text": "you have to prove the air worthiness of handling qualities of the aircraft"
    },
    {
      "s": 1059.96,
      "e": 1063.14,
      "text": "that each test point along the way to give you the confidence"
    },
    {
      "s": 1063.14,
      "e": 1066.15,
      "text": "that you can continue to expand to both higher and faster"
    },
    {
      "s": 1066.15,
