    {
      "s": 1086.2,
      "e": 1090.01,
      "text": "and the vehicle systems, both in the up and away configuration"
    },
    {
      "s": 1090.01,
      "e": 1093.54,
      "text": "with gear up and the, landing gear down configuration."
    },
    {
      "s": 1096.43,
